{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 27.1, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Consider alternative instrument designs or fresh observation in new domain per D083", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "Built E093 discrimination test prototype in EXPERIMENTS/093-discrimination-test. Tested 3 instruments against hand-classified ground truth from E083 aviation maintenance experiment (30 statements: 0 served, 6 partially_served, 24 unserved). All instruments failed G2 (≥0.85 accuracy on 5 known-served + 5 known-unserved): v1 (subject mention + guide): 1/10 accuracy, v2 (subject + step-by-step/part-info): 1/10 accuracy, original keyword classifier: 3/10 accuracy (confirming F109/E088 finding of 0.70 actual experiment accuracy). Key finding: no tested instrument passes G2. Per D088/D095, route must be re-entered through a discrimination test that passes on labels known by construction, not through another domain screen. Do not start from classify_served over Bing in a new domain.", "unlogged_changes": 29}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 32, "session": "2026-10-11-008-build-and-evaluate-discrimination-test-p", "ts": "2026-10-11T08:12:42+00:00"}
